- source: community/modules/compute/schedmd-slurm-gcp-v6-partition
  kind: terraform
  id: {{ part_id }}
  use:
  - {{ part_id }}-nodeset
  settings:
    partition_name: {{ partition_name }}
    exclusive: {% if static_node_count > 0 %}False{% else %}True{% endif %}
    resume_timeout: 1800

- source: community/modules/compute/schedmd-slurm-gcp-v6-nodeset
  id: {{ part_id }}-nodeset
  use:
{{ uses_str }}
  settings:
    bandwidth_tier: platform_default
    subnetwork_self_link: "projects/{{ cluster.project_id }}/regions/{{ cluster.cloud_region }}/subnetworks/{{ cluster.subnet.cloud_id }}"
    service_account_email: $(hpc_service_account.service_account_email)
    service_account_scopes:
      - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/cloud-platform
      - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/monitoring.write
      - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/logging.write
      - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/devstorage.read_write
      - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/pubsub
    advanced_machine_features:
      threads_per_core: 1
    enable_placement: False
    machine_type: {{ machine_type }}
    on_host_maintenance: {% if gpu_count > 0 or gpu_from_machine_type %}TERMINATE{% else %}MIGRATE{% endif %}
    node_count_dynamic_max: {{ dynamic_node_count }}
    node_count_static: {{ static_node_count }}
    {% if extra_zones %}
    zones:
    {% for zone in extra_zones %}
      - {{ zone }}
    {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
    {% if reservation_name %}
    reservation_name: "projects/{{ cluster.project_id }}/reservations/{{ reservation_name }}"
    {% endif %}
    disk_size_gb: {{ boot_disk_size }}
    disk_type: {{ boot_disk_type }}
    instance_image:
    {% if cluster.login_node_image %}
{% comment %}An explicit custom image always wins - it may carry a GRID driver.{% endcomment %}
      family: image-{{ cluster.login_node_image.family }}
      project: {{ cluster.project_id }}
    {% elif gpu_count > 0 or gpu_from_machine_type %}
{% comment %}
GPU desktops need a driver WITH graphics support. Of the published slurm-gcp
families only Debian has one: the ubuntu nvidia family ships a compute-only
driver with no libEGL_nvidia, and the Rocky families ship graphics userspace with
no driver at all (which also makes Xvnc segfault without "-extension GLX").
Defaulting to Rocky here produced a GPU desktop that silently rendered in
software.

Note: Django templates only support {# #} on a single line - a multi-line one is
emitted verbatim and breaks the generated YAML. Use {% comment %} for these.
{% endcomment %}
      family: slurm-gcp-6-12-debian-12
      project: schedmd-slurm-public
    {% else %}
      family: slurm-gcp-6-12-hpc-rocky-linux-9
      project: schedmd-slurm-public
    {% endif %}
    {% if gpu_count > 0 and not gpu_from_machine_type %}
    guest_accelerator:
      - type: {{ gpu_type }}
        count: {{ gpu_count }}
    {% endif %}
    tags:
      - ghpc-novnc-desktop
    startup_script: $(viz_desktop_startup.startup_script)
